        "kind": "pull_request",
        "title": "fix(agent): synchronize AgentTurnBoundary hasPerceived updates",
        "body": "## Summary\n\n`AgentTurnBoundary` is `@unchecked Sendable` and mutates `hasPerceived` inside `record` without synchronization. Concurrent tool classification can race the perceive → action stop decision.\n\nThis PR serializes `record` state access with an `NSLock` and adds a concurrent regression test.\n\n## Failure scenario\n\n1. Multiple concurrent tool completions call `record` on the same boundary.\n2. Unsynchronized `hasPerceived` read/write can miss a stop decision or tear the flag.\n\n## Verification\n\n- `swift build --target PeekabooAgentRuntime` → complete\n- Added concurrent `record` test (CI executes under full Xcode).\n\n## Scope\n\n`AgentTurnBoundary.record` state only.",
